{"articleNo":"158016","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=158016&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[한국지역정보개발원] 지방행정종합정보공개시스템 '16년 신규정보 발굴 의견조사","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.09.12","hit":"2085","attachments":[{"name":"내고장알리미 신규정보 발굴 설문조사 계획.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=158016&attachNo=77116"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-TOP: 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">행정자치부와 한국지역정보개발원에서는 지방행정의 투명성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">책임성 강화와 주민참여 활성화를 위하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">‘</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지방행정종합정보공개시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이하 내고장알리미</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)’</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">을 운영하고 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">주민이 관심있고 실생활에 필요한 정보의 발굴과 선정을 위한 의견수렴을 하고자 하니 참고바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">설문기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: 2016. 9. 9.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) ~ 9. 22.(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">), 14</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일간</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">조사대상 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일반국민 및 자치단체 및 중앙부처 전 공무원 등</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">참여방법 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">내고장알리미</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(www.laiis.go.kr) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">홈페이지를 통한 설문참여</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">○ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">설문조사 참여자 중 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">20</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명을 전산 추첨하여 상품권</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(20,000</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지급</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">○ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">’16. 9. 27(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">화</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">당첨자 발표</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">내고장알리미 홈페이지 공지 예정</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
